{"version":1,"content":"<p>澳大利亞科廷大學的天文學家發現了一個極其罕見的雙星系統，其中一顆已經死亡的恆星——白矮星，每隔約8分鐘便會發射一次規律的無線電脈衝。它的伴星則是一顆與太陽相似的恆星。這是科學家首次在白矮星與類太陽恆星組成的雙星系統中探測到這種周期性無線電信號，為理解銀河系中一類神秘天體提供了新的線索。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1586128.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T17:24:27.106192+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T17:00:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T17:17:38.068502+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T17:17:38.068502+00:00","content_hash":"a7257325d01bfb7a439502c9953303c8d5d3f0b1ab6eddea0ce864e9213caf12","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}